        // The floor's RECOVERABLE-NAME hook: on a js_scope_get miss the floor
        // (languages/lib/runtime.c) and abnf/jsrt.go call a per-language closure that
        // ANSWERS the value to throw instead of aborting. php's answer is
        // js_phmissname's: PHP's `Error: Call to undefined function zzz()` for a
        // bareword. A variable never gets here: it is read with js_scope_own, and
        // `$this` with a probe (phThisFetch). The registration has to
